{"story":{"id":"site-city-of-bones","title":{"zh":"白骨之城","en":"City of Bones"},"category":"precursors","kind":"site","image":"art/edb1471ee9ca2ab6ac76.webp","start":"archaeological_site_types:city_of_bones","chapters":4,"visible":true,"excerpt":{"zh":"一个完全由不明骨头建造的原始城市废墟在经历这颗星球上的一场强力沙尘暴之后被发现。\n\n我们的科学家渴望发掘这座可怕的古城。","en":"The ruins of a primeval city built entirely out of bones of an unknown origin have been unearthed following a violent sandstorm on this planet.\n\nOur archaeologists are eager to begin excavation on this grisly ancient city."},"tree":{"root":"n0","nodes":{"n0":{"doc":null,"children":["n1"]},"n1":{"doc":"archaeological_site_types:city_of_bones","parent":"n0","via":{"kind":"entry"},"children":["n2"]},"n2":{"doc":"ancrel.2041","parent":"n1","via":{"hooks":["stage:","stage_event"],"kind":"stage","source":"common/archaeological_site_types/02_ancient_relics_arc_sites.txt:1797"},"children":["n3"]},"n3":{"doc":"ancrel.2042","parent":"n2","via":{"kind":"stage","hooks":["stage"],"source":"common/archaeological_site_types/02_ancient_relics_arc_sites.txt"},"children":["n4"]},"n4":{"doc":"ancrel.2043","parent":"n3","via":{"kind":"stage","hooks":["stage"],"source":"common/archaeological_site_types/02_ancient_relics_arc_sites.txt"},"children":[]}}}},"chapters":[{"id":"archaeological_site_types:city_of_bones","kind":"site","title":{"zh":"白骨之城","en":"City of Bones"},"texts":[{"zh":"一个完全由不明骨头建造的原始城市废墟在经历这颗星球上的一场强力沙尘暴之后被发现。\n\n我们的科学家渴望发掘这座可怕的古城。","en":"The ruins of a primeval city built entirely out of bones of an unknown origin have been unearthed following a violent sandstorm on this planet.\n\nOur archaeologists are eager to begin excavation on this grisly ancient city."},{"zh":"这颗星球上发现了一个完全由不明骨头建造的原始城市废墟。\n\n我们的科学家渴望发掘这座可怕的废墟。","en":"The ruins of a primeval city built entirely out of bones of an unknown origin have been found on this planet.\n\nOur archaeologists are eager to begin excavation on these grisly ruins."}],"sections":[{"zh":"一个完全由不明骨头建造的原始城市废墟在经历这颗星球上的一场强力沙尘暴之后被发现。\n\n我们的科学家渴望发掘这座可怕的古城。","en":"The ruins of a primeval city built entirely out of bones of an unknown origin have been unearthed following a violent sandstorm on this planet.\n\nOur archaeologists are eager to begin excavation on this grisly ancient city."},{"zh":"这颗星球上发现了一个完全由不明骨头建造的原始城市废墟。\n\n我们的科学家渴望发掘这座可怕的废墟。","en":"The ruins of a primeval city built entirely out of bones of an unknown origin have been found on this planet.\n\nOur archaeologists are eager to begin excavation on these grisly ruins."}],"image":"art/edb1471ee9ca2ab6ac76.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[],"next":[{"target":"ancrel.2041","kind":"stage","conditional":false,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"stage","source":"common/archaeological_site_types/02_ancient_relics_arc_sites.txt:1797","hooks":["stage:","stage_event"],"story":"site-city-of-bones"},{"target":"ancrel.8000","kind":"failure","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"failure","chance":0.0002,"group":"r29675","modified":true,"source":"common/scripted_effects/archaeology_event_effects.txt:2","hooks":["on_roll_failed"],"story":"archaeology-incidents"},{"target":"ancrel.8001","kind":"failure","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"failure","chance":0.0011,"group":"r29675","modified":true,"source":"common/scripted_effects/archaeology_event_effects.txt:3","hooks":["on_roll_failed"],"story":"archaeology-incidents"},{"target":"ancrel.8002","kind":"failure","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"failure","chance":0.0011,"group":"r29675","modified":true,"source":"common/scripted_effects/archaeology_event_effects.txt:4","hooks":["on_roll_failed"],"story":"archaeology-incidents"},{"target":"ancrel.8003","kind":"failure","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"failure","chance":0.0011,"group":"r29675","modified":true,"source":"common/scripted_effects/archaeology_event_effects.txt:5","hooks":["on_roll_failed"],"story":"archaeology-incidents"},{"target":"ancrel.8010","kind":"failure","conditional":true,"de